Application:
{"vehicle": {"type": "BEV", "list_price_eur": 45000}, "approved_line_eur": 40000, "application_date": "2026-10-19"}

Lending handbook:
{"document_id": "LENDING-2026-01", "title": "Vehicle lending handbook", "published_date": "2026-01-01", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "content": "For a vehicle purchase, the amount financed is the purchase price. Compare the amount financed with the applicant's preapproved credit line. Approve an amount at or below that line; otherwise reject. Record the purchase price, any purchase grant applied, the amount financed, and the credit line in the decision. Vehicle categories are BEV (battery electric), PHEV (plug-in hybrid), and ICE (internal combustion)."}

